sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 用户 as U
    participant 微信小程序 as MP
    participant AppGoodsController as C
    participant IClGoodsService as S
    participant ClGoodsMapper as M
    participant MySQL as DB

    U->>MP: 浏览商品列表
    MP->>C: GET /api/app/goods/list
    Note over C: 构建查询对象<br/>强制 status=0
    C->>S: selectClGoodsList(query)
    S->>M: 动态 SQL
    M->>DB: SELECT cl_goods
    DB-->>M: 结果集
    M-->>S: List
    S-->>C: 商品列表
    C-->>MP: AjaxResult
    Note over MP: toAbsoluteUrl 处理封面
    MP-->>U: 渲染列表
